{"id":"nyamuru_voice_3100","text":"今の作品を保存するところまでお願い。これで今日の作業は終わり。","label":"save","slots":{"target":"current_document"},"group":"v04_dev_final_extra_operation_then_closure","tags":["current_document","session_closure"],"note":"現在作品の保存を依頼。作業終了は予定の補足であり、閉じる操作などを追加で依頼していない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_3101","text":"この作品の保存、引き受けてもらえる？　ここまで直した内容で。","label":"save","slots":{"target":"current_document"},"group":"v04_dev_final_extra_delegated_request_postposed_contents","tags":["request_question","current_document"],"note":"保存という具体的な作業を引き受けるよう頼む依頼。後置句は現在作品の保存内容を指定。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_3102","text":"直前と、その一つ前の編集、合わせて二回のUndoをお願い。","label":"undo","slots":{"count":2},"group":"v04_dev_final_extra_enumerated_history_count","tags":["undo_count_two","edit_enumeration"],"note":"直前の編集とその前の編集を列挙し、同一Undo二回として依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_3103","text":"最後に入れた変更を、編集履歴で取り消してほしいんだ。一回分です。","label":"undo","slots":{"count":1},"group":"v04_dev_final_extra_history_request_postposed_count","tags":["undo_count_one","completed_edit"],"note":"最後に完了した編集の取り消しを依頼し、一回という回数を後置。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_3104","text":"さっきUndoを三回かけた分、履歴から三件とも再適用をお願いします。","label":"redo","slots":{"count":3},"group":"v04_dev_final_extra_past_undo_count_to_redo","tags":["redo_count_three","past_undo"],"note":"三回のUndoは過去の報告。現在はその三件を同じRedo操作で再適用する依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_3105","text":"履歴の「やり直し」を一回お願い。対象は、直前にUndoした編集。","label":"redo","slots":{"count":1},"group":"v04_dev_final_extra_quoted_action_postposed_target","tags":["redo_count_one","quoted_action_name"],"note":"引用は履歴操作名であり、直前にUndoした編集を一回再適用する依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_3106","text":"ページをめくる操作で、先へ二回お願いします。","label":"page_navigate","slots":{"direction":"next","count":2},"group":"v04_dev_final_extra_repeated_navigation_nominal","tags":["next_page","repeat_count"],"note":"作品内のページ送りを前方へ二回という同一操作の回数指定。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
